Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Tags|
		|testray.main.component.name|Tags|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	Then ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Cannot Add Empty Tag
Priority: 4
	Given Tag add With Null Title CP
		|tagName| |
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	Then Portlet view Empty Message
		|message|There are no tags.|
Scenario: View Tags Pagination
Priority: 4
	Given Tag add Multiple CP
		|tagNames|tagname01,tagname02,tagname03,tagname04,tagname05,tagname06,tagname07,tagname08,tagname09,tagname10,tagname11,tagname12,tagname13,tagname14,tagname15,tagname16,tagname17,tagname18,tagname19,tagname20,tagname21,tagname22,tagname23,tagname24,tagname25|
	When AssertTextEquals the value '20 Entries' at locator 'Pagination#ITEMS_PER_PAGE_SELECT'
	And Pagination view Results
		|results|Showing 1 to 20 of 25 entries.|
	And Pagination change Pagination
		|itemsPerPage|5|
	Then Pagination view Results
		|results|Showing 1 to 5 of 25 entries.|